#: ../../tools/civic_tools.rst:282 d808e74ff9f1439f80788186710c5ed2
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search for evidence items in CIViC database. Evidence "
"items are curated statements linking variants or molecular profiles to "
"clinical outcomes, therapies, or disease states. Returns evidence with "
"disease, therapies, significance, direction, and citation. Filter by "
"therapy name (e.g., 'imatinib'), disease name (e.g., 'leukemia'), or "
"molecular profile name (e.g., 'BRAF V600E')."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/civic_tools.rst:286 a9f3e223ca7c47fbbe9f8e057c4f9e4f
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of evidence items to return"
" (default: 20, recommended max: 100)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/civic_tools.rst:289 1328bae3a0194a1db12ce73765f90bb4
msgid ""
"``status`` (string, null) (optional) Filter by curation status. Default: "
"ACCEPTED (peer-reviewed). Options: ACCEPTED, SUBMITTED, REJECTED, ALL "
"(returns all statuses combined)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/civic_tools.rst:292 4bc4322880ce4b8faa38b320d84516e0
msgid ""
"``therapy`` (string) (optional) Filter by therapy/drug name (e.g., "
"'imatinib', 'pembrolizumab'). Alias: therapy\\_name. Note: matches any "
"evidence item where the therapy appears, including combination regimens —"
" results may include multi-drug combinations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/civic_tools.rst:298 5bdf6a832d6448619b3dd53a868b299a
msgid ""
"``disease`` (string) (optional) Filter by disease name (e.g., 'leukemia',"
" 'melanoma', 'lung cancer'). Alias: disease\\_name. Note: CIViC uses "
"specific disease names (e.g., 'Lung Non-small Cell Carcinoma', not "
"'NSCLC'); try partial names or multiple searches if results are empty."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/civic_tools.rst:304 6ab2f4ec5e3e4d379933ece9a2af4368
msgid ""
"``molecular_profile`` (string) (optional) Filter by molecular profile "
"name (e.g., 'BRAF V600E', 'EGFR T790M', 'KRAS G12C'). Uses substring "
"matching — 'FLT3 ITD' will also match 'FLT3 ITD AND FLT3 D835Y'. For gene"
" fusions, CIViC uses double-colon notation: 'GENE::PARTNER Fusion' (e.g.,"
" 'FGFR2::BICC1 Fusion', 'ALK::EML4 Fusion'). Use "
"civic\\_search\\_molecular\\_profiles to discover exact profile names."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/civic_tools.rst:307 d31194bfda454a78a1c22187bb05f07f
msgid ""
"``evidence_type`` (string, null) (optional) Filter by evidence type. "
"Values: PREDICTIVE (drug response), DIAGNOSTIC (disease diagnosis), "
"PROGNOSTIC (patient outcomes), PREDISPOSING (disease risk), ONCOGENIC "
"(variant pathogenicity), FUNCTIONAL (molecular function)."
msgstr ""

